{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING: THIS GAME CONTAINS STROBING LIGHTS AND HARSH FLASHES.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISTURBING CONTENT: THIS GAME FEATURES DISTURBING CONTENT AND IS NOT SUITABLE FOR CHILDREN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old, unfinished Lily's Lil Games webseries is back, and recompiled for modern systems! In the second installment, you can see how the development of the DREAMCORE Engine (TM) was moving along and allowing FlashFire Games to develop more interesting web games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOW WITH 3D MINI-GAMES AND LESS LOOPING!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Summer's family barn, where every day is a hard work! Lily has decided to help Summer out for the fall season and they hope to restore Summer's family business back to it's glory days!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lily's job doesn't sound too hard:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd5a Clean the chicken co-op at night, and sort and deliver eggs by day. IN 3D!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd5b Maintain the Pasteurizer by night, and deliver milk by day. IN 3D!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udf3e Prepare the emulsifier, and spooky text here by day. IN 3D!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6d Spend time with Summer and Mimi, Lily\u2019s friends are all here!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day presents new challenges, new visitors, and new chances to help Lily restore Summer's family farm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farm is family!<br>And the dream never dies.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Completed the first day!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4072790/1728eb4559cbd108c1fe1711ee5a497b7d863188.jpg"},{"name":"Clean the Chicken Pen!","path"